NonZeroScript
=============

NonZeroScript is the official Godot edition of ZeroScript, distributed under
the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (see LICENSE).

Upstream project
----------------
ZeroScript — Free AI Agent for Roblox Studio
https://github.com/sebattfg/ZeroScript-Free
https://zerodev.tools/zeroscript

The original ZeroScript is licensed under GPL-3.0. Its agent-loop design,
command protocol, browser-extension architecture and the per-site AI adapters
were used as the starting point for this edition. The Godot editor plugin, the
visual controller (console + relay), multi-browser rotation and the timeline
memory system are new work in NonZeroScript and are released under the same
license.

This edition contains no Roblox Studio integration, Roblox MCP bridge, Luau
runtime or Roblox-specific documentation.

